cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the data or analyses in this repository, please cite this work
  and identify the release or commit used.
type: software
title: "Epic Children: Recorded Children in Epics and Historical Accounts"
authors:
  - family-names: Sood
    given-names: Gaurav
repository-code: "https://github.com/soodoku/epic_children"
url: "https://github.com/soodoku/epic_children"
abstract: >-
  Sourced parent-child records and reproducible R analyses of recorded sons
  and daughters in selected epics, religious texts, and historical accounts,
  including alternative source codings and sensitivity checks.
keywords:
  - genealogies
  - epics
  - descriptive analysis
